      "name": "v0.4.0-rodrigo.7 — On-demand skill discovery",
      "draft": false,
      "immutable": false,
      "prerelease": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-03T09:59:33Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-03T10:00:38Z",
      "published_at": "2026-10-03T10:00:38Z",
      "assets": [],
      "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigojager/pi-agent-switcher/tarball/v0.4.0-rodrigo.7",
      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rodrigojager/pi-agent-switcher/zipball/v0.4.0-rodrigo.7",
      "body": "Fully on-demand skill discovery for dedicated Pi profiles.\n\r\n- Separate GPT-6 Astra/high planner from GPT-6.1 Sol/medium orchestrator. Planner writes durable vertical-slice plans and task contracts; orchestrator coordinates verified implementation.\r\n- Use GPT-6 Luna for executor/reviewer and low-effort browser/desktop operators. Keep workspace-scout user-only, with automatic delegation blocked.\r\n- Keep Higgsfield and Blender specialists adjustable, with scoped MCP access and on-demand skill families. Add /agent-config to save model/effort for future main and child runs.\r\n- Advertise no automatic skill catalogs, including Pi default/reset. Discover and load only explicitly requested permitted skills through local tools; omit old system catalog patches and other profiles' discovery results.\n- Restore the existing Codex account-pool provider for explicitly configured children. Retain Open Video Animator ownership contracts in English.\r\n\r\nValidation: TypeScript and runtime tests verify zero automatic skill catalogs across all nine profiles, permitted on-demand Superbuild loading, denied cross-profile loading, profile switching and Pi default/reset. A clean production installation also checks real offline child execution. No paid model requests were used for these checks.\n\r\nProfiles, installation instructions and all fork changes are included in the repository. Use /reload when Pi is idle; running sessions/jobs are not restarted automatically. Blender CLI is installed, but a Blender MCP connection is not configured. Higgsfield execution still requires service authentication.\r\n"
    },
