      "body": "Switch the main Pi conversation from **Alt+A** with a searchable agent popup: bold names followed by descriptions, filtering by either field, keyboard navigation and an active-profile marker.\n\n- Reuse existing global/project agent definitions; persist the selected profile on the session branch.\n- Apply model, thinking, tools and skill-catalog settings immediately; `/agent reset` restores the session baseline.\n- Delegate with `/delegate` or `@agent task` through Rodrigo's existing Pi Subagent runtime, preserving progress cards and cancellation. Requires Pi Subagent v0.12.4-rodrigo.2.\n- Preserve native Ctrl+A, Ctrl+P and file completion.\n- Document all upstream differences in CHANGES.md and archive provenance in UPSTREAM.md.\n\nValidation: TypeScript check and 16 tests passed, including a real Pi SDK session that spawns an offline child process without an extra main-model request. Pi 1.0.0 or newer required.\n\nThe attached archive contains the runtime package. This repository is a maintained copy of the upstream monorepo package; the unchanged original is retained in Git history.\n"
